// surfaces radiating from the trailing edge are RADII of it; and those
// 3 BISECT THE EXTERIOR ANGLE EQUALLY -- here 85.8657 deg each,
// from a wedge of 16.5372 deg, DERIVED from this body's own two
// trailing-edge tangents rather than written down.
